#, no-wrap
msgid "The QUICK-PDE function is available in three plan sizes: Small, Medium, and Large. The following table gives the limits and the services of each size.\n"
msgstr "Funkcja QUICK-PDE jest dostępna w trzech rozmiarach planu: Small, Medium i Large. Poniższa tabela podaje limity i usługi każdego rozmiaru.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Size | Mode         | Iterations max (all stages)     | Shots max per job | Max qubits                    | Compute profile (vCPU x RAM Go) |\n"
"| ---- | ------------ | ------------------------------- | ----------------- | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n"
"| S    | Job mode     | 25                              | 10,000            | 15                            | 8x32                            |\n"
"| M    | Job mode     | 50                              | 50,000            | 35                            | 16x128              |\n"
"| L    | Session mode | Unlimited (up to session limit) | 100,000           | Unlimited (up to QPU limits)  | 48x768                          |\n"
