"| ---- | ------------ | ------------------------------- | ----------------- | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n"
"| S    | Job mode     | 25                              | 10,000            | 15                            | 8x32                            |\n"
"| M    | Job mode     | 50                              | 50,000            | 35                            | 16x128              |\n"
"| L    | Session mode | Bez limitu (do limitu sesji)    | 100,000           | Bez limitu (do limitów QPU)   | 48x768                          |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
